Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛杉矶 公元2029年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.14,0:01:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些机器从核子战火中崛起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们灭绝人类的战争肆虐数十年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但最后的一场仗不会在未来掀起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会发生在这里  就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.82,0:01:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,片名: 终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛杉矶1984年凌晨1点52分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?  他妈的\N{\rEng}What the hell? Goddamn son-of-a-bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事?\N{\rEng}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮到我了\N{\rEng}Hey, my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\rEng}come on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个人在搞什么鬼?\N{\rEng}Hey, what's wrong with this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜色很好  适宜散步?\N{\rEng}Nice night for a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜色很好  适宜散步\N{\rEng}Nice night for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天是洗衣日  没干净衣服穿  是吗?\N{\rEng}Wash day tomorrow. Nothing clean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  没干净衣服\N{\rEng}Nothing clean. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:06:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个家伙一定是喝醉了\N{\rEng}I think this guy's a couple of cans short of a six-pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的衣服  马上给我\N{\rEng}Your clothes, give them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:06.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-快啊  -去你的  混蛋\N{\rEng}-Now.  -Fuck you, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.07,0:06:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  甜心  怎么样?\N{\rEng}Hey, sugar, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不必忍受那个的\N{\rEng}I don't have to put up with that bullshit, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她老是缠着我\N{\rEng}She's always after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟  你有没有见到一道强光?\N{\rEng}Hey, buddy, did you just see a real bright light?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-看到那家伙吗?  -别动\N{\rEng}-See that guy?  -Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-他在逃跑  -别动  去吧\N{\rEng}-He's rabbiting.  -Hey! I said hold it! Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个混蛋抢了我的裤子\N{\rEng}That son-of-a-bitch took my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-今天是什么日子?  日期  -5月12号\N{\rEng}-What day is it? The date.  -12th May.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-星期四  -什么年份?\N{\rEng}-Thursday.  -What year?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他抢了我的枪  快追\N{\rEng}He's got my gun. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·康纳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大块头  替我守着它\N{\rEng}Guard it for me, Big Buns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  我迟到了\N{\rEng}Hi. I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\rEng}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·康纳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-开工了  -我也是\N{\rEng}-I'm in it.  -So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-麻烦你拿咖啡给我  好吗?  -好的\N{\rEng}-Honey, can I have that coffee now?  -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-牛排是谁的?  -我叫了烤牛肉\N{\rEng}-OK. Who gets the burly-beef?  -I ordered barbecued.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫的  但我没有叫薯条\N{\rEng}That's mine, but I didn't order fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我叫的是辣牛肉  -谁点牛排?\N{\rEng}-Mine's the chilli beef deluxe. -Who gets the burly-beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们想点菜  -好的\N{\rEng}-We're ready to order now.  -Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是真皮吧?\N{\rEng}This isn't real leather, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.03,0:13:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  做得好  我该把小费给你\N{\rEng}Nice going, kid. I ought to give you the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要这样想  一百年后谁会在乎?\N{\rEng}Look at it this way. In 100 years, who's gonna care?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那支12口径自动步枪\N{\rEng}The 12-gauge auto-loader.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.93,0:14:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意大利制造  可以选手动或自动\N{\rEng}That's ltalian. You can go pump or auto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:04.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点45口径滑动式配镭射瞄准器\N{\rEng}The 45 long slide with laser sighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.77,0:14:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全新的  我们刚收到的  是支好枪\N{\rEng}These are new. We just got them in. That's a good gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镭射光亮起时\N{\rEng}The beam comes on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把红点对准目标就行\N{\rEng}you put the red dot where you want the bullet to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百发百中\N{\rEng}You can't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-还有什么需要?  -40瓦的同步等离子步枪\N{\rEng}-Anything else? -Plasma rifle in the 40-watt range.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你看到的了\N{\rEng}Hey, just what you see, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那支乌兹型九毫米\N{\rEng}The Uzi nine millimetre.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很熟识枪械\N{\rEng}You know your weapons, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何一支都适合家居防卫\N{\rEng}Any one of these is ideal for home defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  要哪一支呢?\N{\rEng}So which will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-全部  -今天可以提早关门了\N{\rEng}-All.  -I may close early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:43.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手枪要等15日  但步枪现在就能拿走了\N{\rEng}It's a 15-day wait on the handguns, but the rifles you can take now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.14,0:14:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你不能这样做  -错\N{\rEng}-You can't do that.  -Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.13,0:15:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  宝贝  是我\N{\rEng}Hi, baby. Yeah, yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你来接我  我的电单车坏了\N{\rEng}Listen, I need you to come pick me up. My bike just broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不管你在做什么  快来接我  什么...\N{\rEng}I don't care what you're doing. Come and get me. What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.77,0:15:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫特?\N{\rEng}Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的态度很有问题\N{\rEng}Hey, man, you got a serious attitude problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫特  你在哪里?\N{\rEng}Matt! where are you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  你在干什么?\N{\rEng}come on  what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·康纳...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-萨拉·康纳?  -是的\N{\rEng}-Sarah Connor?  -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:39.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在休息  卡拉代替我\N{\rEng}I'm on my break, Chuck. Carla's got my station.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉  过来  这算是跟你有关的\N{\rEng}Sarah, come here. It's about you. I mean, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不可思议  你不会相信的  -你会喜欢这个的\N{\rEng}-Incredible.You're not gonna believe this.  -You're going to love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-什么?  -有几个目击证人指出\N{\rEng}-What?  -compiled from several witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一位萨拉·康纳  35岁  有两名子女\N{\rEng}Once again, Sarah Connor, 35, mother of two,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天下午在家里中枪身亡\N{\rEng}brutally shot to death this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\rEng}You're dead, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢音响\N{\rEng}if you're into sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最佳的音响 就是鲍博立体声\N{\rEng}for the greatest sound around, come to Bob's Stereo at 2500 Sepulveda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.71,0:20:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有低音炮 高频炮 数码扬声器和镭射唱片\N{\rEng}We've got woofers, tweeters, the newest in audio and compact discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有图表均衡器和音响平衡器\N{\rEng}We've got graphic equalisers and sound balancers that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先  我会一个个的解开你的衫钮\N{\rEng}First I'm gonna rip the buttons off your blouse one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后用舌头 从你的头舔到你赤裸的乳房\N{\rEng}then run my tongue down your neck to your bare, gleaming breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.05,0:21:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后慢慢地  逐英寸地脱掉你的牛仔裤\N{\rEng}And then slowly...slowly pull your jeans off inch by inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金珍  是马特\N{\rEng}Ginger, it's Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:30.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后舔你的肚皮...再往下面去\N{\rEng}And lick your belly in circles further and further down,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后用牙齿...脱掉你的内裤\N{\rEng}and then pull your panties off with my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\rEng}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  萨拉?\N{\rEng}God. Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天  对不起\N{\rEng}Jesus. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你是...我想找金珍\N{\rEng}I thought you were...Can I talk to Ginger?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:51.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个变态鬼\N{\rEng}It's the creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:53.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先  我会一个个解开你的衫钮\N{\rEng}First I'll rip the buttons off your blouse one by one...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这群混蛋  等着我对付你们  放手\N{\rEng}You fucking pigs. Wait till I get my hands on you. Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\rEng}sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.27,0:22:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾特\N{\rEng}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你有什么?  -女死者\N{\rEng}-What have you got?  -Dead girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.90,0:22:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我看得到  -萨拉·康纳  秘书  35岁\N{\rEng}-I can see that.  -Sarah Ann Connor, secretary, 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在不足十英尺内身中六枪  大口径武器\N{\rEng}Shot six times at less than 10 feet. Large calibre weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.49,0:22:21.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看得清楚\N{\rEng}You know, these work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这是什么?  -第二名女死者\N{\rEng}-What's this?  -Dead girl two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天下午山谷区分区送过来的\N{\rEng}Sent over from the Valley division this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定这些命案是有动机的\N{\rEng}Are you sure there's a point to all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看死者的名字\N{\rEng}Look at the name, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·路易斯·康纳...有没有弄错?\N{\rEng}Sarah Louise Connor. Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说笑吧\N{\rEng}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报纸会大做文章的\N{\rEng}The press is gonna be short-stroking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-一个有特定模式的凶手  -我讨厌古怪的案件\N{\rEng}-A one-day pattern killer.  -I hate the weird ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.85,0:22:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:22:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比凡人得到的更好\N{\rEng}Better than mortal man deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.91,0:23:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你有见过宝斯利吗?  -最近没有\N{\rEng}-Ginger, have you seen Pugsley?  -Not lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你听了口信没有?  -我以为你听了\N{\rEng}-Did you check messages?  -I thought you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.00,0:23:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-萨拉  是妈  -原来你在这里\N{\rEng}-Hi, Sarah, this is your mom...  -There you are, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.13,0:23:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想想你妈吧\N{\rEng}You mind your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.21,0:23:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\rEng}Bye
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  萨拉  莫仕庭  有突发事件\N{\rEng}Hi, Sarah. Stan Morsky. Something's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能应约了  我不能丢下不理的\N{\rEng}Looks like I won't be able to make it tonight. Just can't get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我会给你赔罪的\N{\rEng}I'm really sorry. I'll make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改天找你吧  对不起  再见\N{\rEng}Call you in a day or so. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.11,0:23:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个混蛋  有辆保时捷又怎样\N{\rEng}That bum. So what if he has a Porsche?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能这样对你的  这可是周五晚上\N{\rEng}He can't treat you like this. It's Friday night, for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事的\N{\rEng}I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会打爆他的膝盖\N{\rEng}I'll break his kneecaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.16,0:23:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝斯利仍然爱我  是吗?\N{\rEng}Well, Pugsley still loves me. Don't you, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天  真恶心\N{\rEng}God. It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.92,0:24:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看电影  你和马特玩得开心点\N{\rEng}I'm gonna go to a movie, kiddo. You and Matt have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们会的  你也是  -好的\N{\rEng}-We will. You, too.  -OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  马特\N{\rEng}Damn it, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.61,0:25:15.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.78,0:25:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些命案 是依电话簿里的次序发生的?\N{\rEng}These killings occurred in the order of their listings in the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.04,0:25:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我可以说什么?  无可奉告  -但是...\N{\rEng}-What can I tell you? No comment. -But, Lieutenant...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.55,0:25:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那杯咖啡早就凉了\N{\rEng}That coffee's two hours cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还用它弄熄香烟\N{\rEng}I put a cigarette out in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.64,0:25:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-找到下一名女子了吗?  -没  只有电话留言\N{\rEng}-Did you reach the next girl yet? -No. I got her answering machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.27,0:25:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-派组人去  -已经派了  还没回音\N{\rEng}-Send a unit.  -I sent a unit. There's no answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.94,0:25:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-那个经理还没回家  -打电话给她\N{\rEng}-The apartment manager's not in.  -Call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-刚打了  -再打\N{\rEng}-I just called her.  -Call her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.40,0:25:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我一支香烟\N{\rEng}Give me a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.41,0:26:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  捉弄到你了  你在跟留言机谈话\N{\rEng}Hi, there. Fooled you. You're talking to a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.50,0:26:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但别害羞  留言机也需要爱的  跟它谈谈吧\N{\rEng}But don't be shy. It's OK. Machines need love, too, so talk to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.68,0:26:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金珍  是我啦...\N{\rEng}and Ginger, that's me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.85,0:26:18.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者萨拉会回复你的  等候哔哔声啦\N{\rEng}or Sarah will get back to you. Wait for the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是一样\N{\rEng}Same shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.35,0:26:27.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在听到了 就叫他"电话簿杀手"吧\N{\rEng}I can hear it now. He's gonna be called the goddamn Phone Book Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.31,0:26:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌这些触目案件  特别是变态的案件\N{\rEng}I hate these press cases. Especially the weird press cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.02,0:26:36.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你去哪里?  -发表声明\N{\rEng}-Where are you going?  -To make a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.82,0:26:38.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫这班走狗替我们工作\N{\rEng}Maybe make these jackals work for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.99,0:26:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若我11点前能上电视  或许她会找我们的\N{\rEng}If I can get on the tube by eleven o'clock, maybe she'll call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.91,0:26:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样?  我的样子怎样?\N{\rEng}Well, how do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.66,0:26:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-很难看  老总  -不错\N{\rEng}-Like shit, boss.  -Your mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.16,0:26:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚收到消息  警方已经宣布了\N{\rEng}This just in. Police have announced the name of the victim
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.28,0:26:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天发生的命案的  第二名死者的姓名\N{\rEng}in the second of two murders which took place today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.04,0:27:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的是  两名死者都是同名同姓\N{\rEng}Incredibly, the names of the two victims are virtually identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.59,0:27:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两小时前  35岁的萨拉·康纳...被发现死在寓所里\N{\rEng}Two hours ago, 35-year-old Sarah Ann Connor was pronounced dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.89,0:27:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-转台吧  -萨拉·路易斯...\N{\rEng}-Can we change this?  -Sarah Louise...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.26,0:27:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰它\N{\rEng}Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.94,0:27:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她家中被杀\N{\rEng}murdered earlier today in her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.89,0:27:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方拒绝猜测\N{\rEng}Police are refusing to speculate
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.35,0:27:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两宗案件的类同之处\N{\rEng}on the similarity between the shooting deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.48,0:27:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在仍未发现两者之间有何关连\N{\rEng}and no other connection between the two victims has been established yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会随时为大家报导最新消息\N{\rEng}We'll have more on this late-breaking story as it comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.24,0:27:51.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·康纳...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.84,0:28:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑科技酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.41,0:28:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-有电话吗?  -在里面\N{\rEng}-Hey, you got a phone?  -It's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.78,0:29:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四元五角\N{\rEng}Hey. Four-fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.41,0:29:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已接通洛杉矶警局紧急热线\N{\rEng}You have reached the Los Angeles Police emergency number.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有线路正忙\N{\rEng}All lines are busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.57,0:29:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如需警车支援  请稍候\N{\rEng}If you need a police car sent out to you, stay on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.19,0:30:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开  我会拿你来制皮带\N{\rEng}Go on. I'm gonna make a belt out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.78,0:31:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逼我打你\N{\rEng}Don't make me bust you up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.09,0:32:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  捉弄到你了  你在跟留言机谈话\N{\rEng}Hi, there. Fooled you. You're talking to a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.06,0:32:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但别害羞  留言机也需要爱的\N{\rEng}But don't be shy. It's OK. Machines need love, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.14,0:32:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟它谈谈吧...金珍 是我啦 或者萨拉会回复你的\N{\rEng}So talk to it and Ginger, that's me, or Sarah will get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等候哔哔声啦\N{\rEng}Wait for the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.02,0:32:31.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金珍  我是萨拉  快接听\N{\rEng}Ginger. This is Sarah. Pick up if you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.48,0:32:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在比高大道的黑科技酒吧  我很害怕\N{\rEng}I'm at this place on Pico Boulevard called Tech Noir. I'm really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.41,0:32:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人跟踪我\N{\rEng}I think that there's somebody after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.45,0:32:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你快点听这个口信\N{\rEng}I hope that you play this back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.58,0:32:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想让你和马特尽快来接我\N{\rEng}I need you and Matt to come and pick me up as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.29,0:32:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方不停转驳我的电话线  我会再试的\N{\rEng}The police keep transferring me. I'm gonna give 'em another try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.79,0:32:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的号码是5559175  快回电  我要你帮忙\N{\rEng}The number here is 5559175. Call me, kiddo. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.90,0:33:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·康纳
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.40,0:33:14.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她\N{\rEng}It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.78,0:33:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-萨拉·康纳? 我是戴探长  -听着...\N{\rEng}-Sarah Connor? It's Lieutenant Traxler.  -Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.15,0:33:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别要我等或者转线\N{\rEng}Don't put me on hold. Don't transfer me to another department.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.62,0:33:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我不会  -你在哪?\N{\rEng}-I won't.  -Can you tell me where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.99,0:33:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-一间叫黑科技的酒吧  -我知道 在比高大道\N{\rEng}-I'm in this bar called Tech Noir. -I know it. It's on Pico.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你没事吧?  -没事  但我不想离开\N{\rEng}-Are you all right? -Yeah, but I don't wanna leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.87,0:33:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我觉得有人在跟踪我  -留心听着\N{\rEng}-I think there's a guy following me.  -Now, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.13,0:33:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你身处公众地方  会较安全的\N{\rEng}You're in a public place so you'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.02,0:33:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在显眼处  别出去  别上厕所\N{\rEng}Stay visible. Don't go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.05,0:33:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我会很快派车来  -好的\N{\rEng}-I'll have a car there in a minute.  -OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.08,0:34:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个家伙没有付钱\N{\rEng}Hey, that guy didn't pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.94,0:36:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想活着就跟我来\N{\rEng}Come with me if you wanna live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.32,0:37:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\rEng}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.06,0:38:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是1-L19  有人袭击后逃跑\N{\rEng}This is one-L-19. I got a hit-and-run felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.89,0:38:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可疑车辆是旧型灰色福特 在第七街向西逃走\N{\rEng}Suspect vehicle -Iate model grey Ford headed westbound on Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.36,0:38:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他开得很快\N{\rEng}He's really moving -punching lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.65,0:38:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上派救护车 来第七街和百老汇街交界\N{\rEng}I'm gonna need an ambulance at Seventh and Broadway right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.53,0:38:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动\N{\rEng}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.09,0:38:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动\N{\rEng}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.06,0:39:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有受伤?  你有没有中枪?\N{\rEng}Are you injured? Are you shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.24,0:39:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照我的说话做  照着做\N{\rEng}Do exactly what I say. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.86,0:39:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没我允许不准动  不准发出声音\N{\rEng}Don't move unless I say. Don't make a sound unless I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.49,0:39:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吗?\N{\rEng}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.91,0:39:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-明白吗?  -明白  求你别伤害我\N{\rEng}-Do you understand?  -Yes. Please don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.64,0:39:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的\N{\rEng}I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我姓李斯 科技步队中士DN38416 受命来保护你\N{\rEng}I'm Reese. Sergeant Tech-Com. DN38416. Assigned to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.40,0:39:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是被毁灭的目标\N{\rEng}You've been targeted for termination.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.67,0:39:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嫌犯在国民街与奥运道交界 1-L19 请通话\N{\rEng}Attempt to intercept, 1-L19.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是1-L19  在奥运道向西行 接近奥佛兰道\N{\rEng}This is one-L19. Westbound on Olympic. Approaching Overland.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.21,0:40:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是搞错了  我没做过什么\N{\rEng}This is a mistake. I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.84,0:40:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你会做的  你活着很重要\N{\rEng}No, but you will. It's very important that you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.67,0:40:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能  那个人怎能站起来追你...\N{\rEng}This isn't true. How could that man just get up after you...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.30,0:40:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不是人  是机器\N{\rEng}It's not a man. A machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.35,0:40:25.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个魔鬼终结者  电脑达因系统101型号\N{\rEng}A Terminator. Cyberdyne Systems model 101 .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.98,0:40:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器?  像机械人?\N{\rEng}A machine? Like a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.15,0:40:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是机械人  是电子人  电脑控制的生物\N{\rEng}Not a robot. A cyborg-cybernetic organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.82,0:40:45.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不  他刚才在流血  -等一下\N{\rEng}-No. He was bleeding.  -Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.12,0:40:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伏下\N{\rEng}Get your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.12,0:41:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鬼终结者是个混合体\N{\rEng}Listen. The Terminator's an infiltration unit. .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.00,0:41:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,半人半机械\N{\rEng}Part man, part machine
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.71,0:41:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,内里是一个超合金的战斗骨架\N{\rEng}Underneath it's a hyper-alloy combat chassis.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.21,0:41:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由微型处理器操作\N{\rEng}Microprocessor controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.18,0:41:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全副武装  非常强劲  但外表是活人组织\N{\rEng}Fully armoured, very tough. Outside it's living human tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.76,0:41:54.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肌肉 皮肤 毛发 血液 都是为电子人培植的\N{\rEng}Flesh, skin, hair, blood  grown for the cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.23,0:41:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你想我怎样做?  -留心听着\N{\rEng}-Look, Reese, I don't know  -Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.19,0:41:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要弃掉这辆车\N{\rEng}I gotta ditch this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.82,0:42:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,600系列有塑胶皮肤  很容易认得出\N{\rEng}The 600-Series had rubber skin. We spotted them easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.07,0:42:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这批是新造的  它们很像人类\N{\rEng}But these are new. They look human.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.70,0:42:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流汗  口臭  诸如此类 很难辨认\N{\rEng}Sweat, bad breath, everything. Very hard to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.66,0:42:18.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要等他向你下手  才能对付他\N{\rEng}I had to wait till he moved on you before I could zero him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.37,0:42:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我不是蠢才 他们还不能制造那样的东西\N{\rEng}Look, I am not stupid. They cannot make things like that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.17,0:42:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不可以  40年后就可以了\N{\rEng}Not yet. Not for about forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.51,0:42:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说它来自未来?\N{\rEng}Are you saying it's from the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.89,0:42:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个有可能的未来  从你的角度看\N{\rEng}One possible future...from your point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.72,0:42:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对科技一窍不通\N{\rEng}I don't know tech stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.98,0:42:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你也是来自未来?\N{\rEng}Then you're from the future, too. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.86,0:42:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-对  -对\N{\rEng}-Right. -Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.07,0:42:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电子人感觉不到痛楚  可我能  别再那样做\N{\rEng}Cyborgs don't feel pain. I do. Don't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.58,0:43:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-放我走  -听着...还有搞清楚点\N{\rEng}-Just let me go.  -Listen and understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个毁灭者就在外面\N{\rEng}That Terminator is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.42,0:43:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不讲情面  也不讲道理\N{\rEng}It can't be bargained with, it can't be reasoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.84,0:43:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不会同情或后悔...或者恐惧\N{\rEng}It doesn't feel pity or remorse or fear
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.18,0:43:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它绝不会罢休  永远不会  直到你死掉\N{\rEng}and it absolutely will not stop, ever, until you are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.23,0:43:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可否制止它?\N{\rEng}Can you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.37,0:43:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.41,0:43:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠这些武器  我不知道\N{\rEng}With these weapons, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.34,0:44:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有单位\N{\rEng}All units.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.80,0:44:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一个停车场里发现可疑车辆\N{\rEng}Ford suspect vehicle has been found in a parking structure
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.08,0:44:05.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地点是第四街和百老汇街交界\N{\rEng}at Fourth and Beaudry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.22,0:44:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李斯?  为何是我?\N{\rEng}Reese, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.85,0:44:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它为何要对付我?\N{\rEng}Why does it want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.99,0:45:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经发生了一场核战\N{\rEng}There was a nuclear war.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.12,0:45:08.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来数年后\N{\rEng}A few years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.50,0:45:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的一切...这个地方  所有的东西\N{\rEng}all this, this whole place, everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.25,0:45:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会消失  就此消失\N{\rEng}it's gone, just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.63,0:45:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一些生还者\N{\rEng}There were survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.80,0:45:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零星...散落各地\N{\rEng}Here, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.51,0:45:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人知道是谁发动战争\N{\rEng}Nobody even knew who started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.77,0:45:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是那些机器  -我不明白\N{\rEng}-It was the machines, Sarah.  -I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.69,0:45:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防卫网络电脑\N{\rEng}Defence network computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.98,0:45:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新型的  功能强劲\N{\rEng}New, powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.24,0:45:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接驳到所有东西  被委托操控一切重任\N{\rEng}hooked into everything, trusted to run it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.12,0:45:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说它变得聪明起来  一种智能的新秩序\N{\rEng}They say it got smart, a new order of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.33,0:45:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它视所有人类为威胁\N{\rEng}Then it saw all people as a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.49,0:46:02.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能与我们共存\N{\rEng}Not just the ones on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.63,0:46:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在刹那间决定了我们的命运\N{\rEng}It decided our fate in a microsecond.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.01,0:46:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灭绝\N{\rEng}Extermination.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.23,0:46:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可有目睹这场战争?\N{\rEng}Did you see this war?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.20,0:46:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  我在战后长大  在废墟中成长\N{\rEng}No. I grew up after. In the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.17,0:46:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挨饥抵饿  躲避那些HK\N{\rEng}Starving. Hiding from the H-Ks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.38,0:46:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-HK?  -追捕杀手\N{\rEng}-H-Ks?  -Hunter killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.38,0:46:52.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械工厂制造的巡逻机器\N{\rEng}Patrol machines built in automated factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.42,0:46:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大部分人被围捕  关在营里等候被消灭\N{\rEng}Most of us were rounded up. Put in camps for orderly disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.43,0:47:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是被镭射素描器烙下的\N{\rEng}This was burned in by laser scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.94,0:47:09.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有部分人得以活下来  去干活\N{\rEng}Some of us were kept alive. To work.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.27,0:47:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搬运尸体\N{\rEng}Loading bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.94,0:47:15.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些消灭单位日以继夜的运作\N{\rEng}The disposal units ran night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.74,0:47:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们差点就丧命\N{\rEng}We were that close to going out for ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.08,0:47:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有一个人...教我们反抗\N{\rEng}But there was one man who taught us to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.71,0:47:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲击监禁营的线路\N{\rEng}To storm the wire of the camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.87,0:47:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那些金属混蛋撞个稀巴烂\N{\rEng}To smash those metal mother fuckers into junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.71,0:47:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他扭转了局势  带我们脱离险境\N{\rEng}He turned it around. He brought us back from the brink.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.84,0:47:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他姓康纳  约翰·康纳\N{\rEng}His name was Connor. John Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.30,0:47:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的儿子  你未出世的儿子\N{\rEng}Your son, Sarah. Your unborn son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.74,0:49:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来开车\N{\rEng}Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.75,0:49:45.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李斯\N{\rEng}Reese!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.65,0:50:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  李斯  不不  他们会杀死你的\N{\rEng}No, Reese. No, no, no. They'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.23,0:50:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在凯迪拉克里的人  立刻举高双手\N{\rEng}You in the Cadillac, let me see your hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.49,0:50:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下车\N{\rEng}Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.41,0:50:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\rEng}Drop to your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.58,0:50:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-下车  -跪下\N{\rEng}-Out of the car.  -Drop to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.23,0:50:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉...喝一点吧\N{\rEng}Sarah. Sarah, try to drink some of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.32,0:51:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定是他们?\N{\rEng}Listen, are you sure it's them?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.49,0:51:04.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该看看尸体的\N{\rEng}I mean, maybe I should look at the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.62,0:51:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经证实了他们的身份  没错的\N{\rEng}No. They've been identified and there's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.42,0:51:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金珍  小伙子\N{\rEng}Ginger. Kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.51,0:51:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-萨拉  这是索博曼医生  -你好  萨拉\N{\rEng}-Sarah, this is Dr Silberman.  -Hi, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.89,0:51:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他李斯对你说的一切  你应付得来吗\N{\rEng}Tell him everything Reese told you, Sarah. Do you feel up to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.06,0:51:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吧\N{\rEng}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.94,0:51:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你是个医生?  -犯罪学心理医生\N{\rEng}-You're a doctor?  -Criminal psychologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.02,0:51:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-李斯是不是疯的?  -这就是我们要查证的\N{\rEng}-Is Reese crazy?  -That's what we're gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.32,0:53:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个军人吧  保卫着谁?\N{\rEng}So you're a soldier. Fighting for whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.20,0:53:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隶属贝里率领的第132团  从21年到27年\N{\rEng}With the 132nd under Perry. From '21 to '27.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.87,0:53:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...2027年?\N{\rEng}That's the year 2027?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.79,0:53:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  后来我被派到...\N{\rEng}That's right. Then I was assigned...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.96,0:53:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-很好  -当约翰·康纳的部下\N{\rEng}-This is fucking great.  -under John Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.88,0:53:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-敌人是谁?  -一个电脑防卫系统...\N{\rEng}-Who was the enemy?  -A computer defence system...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.09,0:53:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  对不起\N{\rEng}Goddamn! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.51,0:53:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电脑动力系统替萨诺力制造的\N{\rEng}built for SAC-NORAD by Cyberdyne Systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.14,0:53:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\rEng}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.31,0:53:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个电脑认为\N{\rEng}And this computer thinks .
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.09,0:53:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了敌人的母亲  就能胜利\N{\rEng}it can win by killing the mother of its enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.23,0:53:43.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他在孕育前就杀掉\N{\rEng}Killing him, in effect, before he's even conceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.65,0:53:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是倒逆的堕胎?\N{\rEng}A sort of retroactive abortion?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.40,0:53:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索博曼笑死我了  那家伙把他弄得一头雾水\N{\rEng}Silberman cracks me up. Last week, a guy burned his Afghan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.03,0:53:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-他先弄得一团糟  -闭嘴\N{\rEng}-He screwed it first...  -Ed, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.59,0:53:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么为何它...不杀死康纳约翰?\N{\rEng}Why didn't the computer just kill Connor then?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.39,0:53:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何要有这个毁灭者的计划?\N{\rEng}Why this elaborate scheme with the Terminator?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.06,0:54:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它没有选择  它们的防御网络被催毁\N{\rEng}It had no choice. Their defence grid was smashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.64,0:54:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赢了  杀掉康纳约翰也不会有何分别\N{\rEng}We'd won. Taking out Connor then would make no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.15,0:54:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天网要铲除他整个组织\N{\rEng}Skynet had to wipe out his entire existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.19,0:54:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是当你们操控实验室 找到...\N{\rEng}Is that when you captured the lab complex and found...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.99,0:54:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个什么?\N{\rEng}What is it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.11,0:54:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空转移装置?\N{\rEng}The time displacement equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.70,0:54:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错  那个毁灭者已经穿越过来了\N{\rEng}That's right. The Terminator had already gone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.66,0:54:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,康纳派我来拦截  它们炸毁了整个地方\N{\rEng}Connor sent me to intercept and they blew the whole place.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.83,0:54:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你怎么回去?\N{\rEng}Well, how are you supposed to get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.63,0:54:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回不去了\N{\rEng}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.75,0:54:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能回家  也没人能过来\N{\rEng}Nobody goes home. Nobody else comes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.09,0:54:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他...和我\N{\rEng}It's just him and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.99,0:56:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有他...和我\N{\rEng}It's just him and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.58,0:56:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何你没带武器?  一些更先进的武器?\N{\rEng}Why didn't you bring any weapons? Something more advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.83,0:56:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没有镭射枪的吗?\N{\rEng}Don't you have ray guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.83,0:56:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-镭射枪  -给我看看一件未来的科技\N{\rEng}-Ray guns.  -Show me a piece of future technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.50,0:56:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要光着身体\N{\rEng}You go naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.17,0:56:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它跟由生物产生的磁场有关\N{\rEng}Something about the field generated by a living organism
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.30,0:56:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死物是不行的  那鬼东西不是我制造的\N{\rEng}Nothing dead will go. I didn't build the fucking thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.14,0:56:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的...但这个电子人  若它是金属的...\N{\rEng}OK, OK. But this cyborg, if it's metal...?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.77,0:57:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-被活组织包着的  -对  是的\N{\rEng}-Surrounded by living tissue.  -Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.40,0:57:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好东西  我能因他功成名就\N{\rEng}This is great stuff. I could make a career out of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.36,0:57:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这个多聪明?  不需要证据\N{\rEng}You see how clever this part is? It doesn't require a shred of proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.44,0:57:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大部分妄想狂都很复杂  但这个却很精明\N{\rEng}Most paranoid delusions are intricate, but this is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.07,0:57:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-为何另外两女会被杀  -大部分记录都在战争中遗失\N{\rEng}-Why were the other women killed?  -Records were lost in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.04,0:57:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天网对康纳的母亲几乎一无所知\N{\rEng}Skynet knew almost nothing about Connor's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.83,0:57:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道她的全名和地址  只知道在哪个城市\N{\rEng}Her full name, where she lived. They just knew the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.67,0:57:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个毁灭者只是受系统操控\N{\rEng}The Terminator was just being systematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.67,0:57:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们再谈谈...  -你听得够多了\N{\rEng}-Let's go back...  -Look, you have heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.59,0:57:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经回答了你的问题  现在我要见萨拉\N{\rEng}I have answered your questions. I have to see Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.05,0:57:35.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我作不了主  -那为何我要跟你谈?\N{\rEng}-I'm afraid that's not up to me.  -Then why am I talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.01,0:57:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-谁是主管?  -求你...\N{\rEng}-Who is in authority here?  -Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.18,0:57:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\rEng}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.35,0:57:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是不明白  对不对?\N{\rEng}You still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.14,0:57:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会找到她  这就是他要做的  他只会这样做\N{\rEng}He'll find her. That's what he does. That's all he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.52,0:57:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你阻止不了他\N{\rEng}You can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.90,0:57:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会掐住她喉咙 挖出她心脏\N{\rEng}He'll reach down her throat and pull her fucking heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.24,0:57:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-医生  -放开我\N{\rEng}-Doc.  -Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.04,0:58:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.87,0:58:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是疯子?\N{\rEng}He's crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.63,0:58:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用技术性的用语...他是个傻子\N{\rEng}In technical terminology, he's a loon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.76,0:58:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他们所谓的盔甲  我们的特种步队都穿着这个\N{\rEng}Sarah, this is what they call body armour. Our TAC guys wear these.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.26,0:58:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挡到12口径的火力\N{\rEng}It'll stop a 12-gauge round.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.64,0:58:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人一定是穿了它  触摸一下吧\N{\rEng}This other man must've been wearing one under his coat. Feel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.77,0:58:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-打碎挡风玻璃又怎么说?  -他可能服了麻醉药\N{\rEng}-What about he punched through the windshield. -He was probably on PCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.81,0:58:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算断了骨头  他也感觉不到\N{\rEng}Broke every bone in his hand. He wouldn't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.65,0:58:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这个家伙...看见疤痕吗?  -拿着\N{\rEng}-There was this guy once...You see this scar?  -Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.24,0:58:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.40,0:58:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有一张沙发  躺下睡会吧\N{\rEng}There's a couch in this other room. Stretch out and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.12,0:58:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈至少要一小时后  才能到这\N{\rEng}Be at least an hour before your mother gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.79,0:58:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我睡不着  -试试吧\N{\rEng}-I can't sleep.  -Try.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.08,0:58:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那张沙发其貌不扬  但很舒服的\N{\rEng}It may not look it, but that couch is very comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.54,0:58:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会绝对安全的  这座大厦里有30个警员\N{\rEng}You'll be perfectly safe. We got 30 cops in this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.76,0:59:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.60,0:59:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-晚安  -晚安\N{\rEng}-Good night.  -Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.11,0:59:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是萨拉·康纳的朋友\N{\rEng}I'm a friend of Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.78,0:59:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说她在这  我能见她吗\N{\rEng}I was told she's here. Could I see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.91,0:59:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能  你不能见她 她在录口供\N{\rEng}No. Can't see her. She's making a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.58,0:59:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里?\N{\rEng}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.33,0:59:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要一会的\N{\rEng}It make take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.08,0:59:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想等的话  那边有张长椅\N{\rEng}If you wanna wait, there's a bench over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.76,0:59:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会回来\N{\rEng}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.59,1:00:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\rEng}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.86,1:00:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有枪声\N{\rEng}Gunshot!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.31,1:00:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是不是恐怖分子?  -快走\N{\rEng}-What is it, terrorists?  -Let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.23,1:00:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别走开\N{\rEng}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.96,1:01:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们快离开这里 -来吧\N{\rEng}-Let's get out of here! -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.14,1:01:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点...\N{\rEng}Move it, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.84,1:01:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他\N{\rEng}I got him
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.56,1:01:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着他\N{\rEng}Watch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.81,1:01:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-自动式武器 -快点  走吧\N{\rEng}- Automatic weapons!  -Lock and load! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.21,1:02:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,着火了...\N{\rEng}Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.84,1:02:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾特\N{\rEng}Ed
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.95,1:03:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\rEng}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.74,1:03:08.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李斯\N{\rEng}Reese.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.91,1:03:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\rEng}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.00,1:03:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是KFLB新闻时间 频道4.36\N{\rEng} KFLB news time. 4.36.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.66,1:03:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主要新闻 加州历来最大型的\N{\rEng}Top story, the largest single law enforcement mobilisation
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.08,1:04:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,执法行动正在展开\N{\rEng}in California history is currently underway.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.30,1:04:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五个南部县区正在大举搜捕...\N{\rEng}Police in five counties are engaged in a massive manhunt for...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.64,1:04:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\rEng}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.10,1:04:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把这个推离公路\N{\rEng}All right. Let's get this off the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.71,1:04:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你冷吗?  -冻僵了\N{\rEng}-You cold?  -Freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.77,1:05:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李斯?\N{\rEng}Reese?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.73,1:05:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你有名字吗?  -凯尔\N{\rEng}-You got a first name?  -Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.57,1:05:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔  你穿越时空时是怎样的?\N{\rEng}Kyle, what's it like when you go through time?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.70,1:05:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白光\N{\rEng}White light.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.96,1:05:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛楚\N{\rEng}Pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.67,1:05:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-或许就像出生时一样吧  -我的天\N{\rEng}-It's like being born maybe.  -My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.67,1:05:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才吃了一记\N{\rEng}I caught one back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.13,1:05:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你中枪了?  -不是很严重\N{\rEng}-You mean you got shot?  -It's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.80,1:05:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们要找医生  -没事的  算了吧\N{\rEng}-We gotta get you to a doctor.  -It's OK. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.64,1:05:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了?  你疯的吗?  脱下它\N{\rEng}What do you mean, forget it? Are you crazy? Take this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.53,1:06:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天\N{\rEng}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.49,1:06:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它穿过了皮肉\N{\rEng}See? It passed right through the meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.20,1:06:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会使我作呕\N{\rEng}This is gonna make me puke.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.75,1:06:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你跟我谈话好吗?  -谈什么?\N{\rEng}-Would you just talk about something?  -What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.04,1:06:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  随便说吧  谈谈我的儿子\N{\rEng}I don't know. Anything. Just talk. Tell me about my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.42,1:06:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有我这么高大\N{\rEng}He's about my height.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.68,1:06:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有你的眼睛\N{\rEng}He has your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.02,1:06:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是怎样的?\N{\rEng}What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.19,1:06:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你信任他  他有一种力量\N{\rEng}You trust him. He's got a strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.56,1:06:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意为约翰·康纳牺牲\N{\rEng}I'd die for John Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.24,1:06:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在至少知道给他取什么名字\N{\rEng}Well, at least now I know what to name him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.24,1:06:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道他父亲是谁吧\N{\rEng}Don't suppose you know who the father is
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.99,1:06:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让我遇上他时不会叫他滚开\N{\rEng}so I won't tell him to get lost?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.12,1:06:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰从来没有提起他\N{\rEng}John never said much about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.12,1:06:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我知道他在战前死了  -等一会\N{\rEng}-I know he dies before the war...  -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.67,1:07:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想知道\N{\rEng}I don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.46,1:07:03.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是约翰派你来的?\N{\rEng}So was it John that sent you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.01,1:07:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我自愿的\N{\rEng}I volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.80,1:07:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-为什么?  -有机会认识传奇人物\N{\rEng}-Why?  -It was a chance to meet the legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.77,1:07:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉·康纳  教她儿子去抵抗...组织\N{\rEng}Sarah Connor, who taught her son to fight, organise,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.73,1:07:20.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备  从他小时就这样教导他\N{\rEng}prepare from when he was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.02,1:07:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当其他人还在战前躲避时\N{\rEng}When you were in hiding before the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.16,1:07:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用过去式说一些 我还没做的事\N{\rEng}You're talking about things I haven't done yet in the past tense.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.74,1:07:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的令我发疯\N{\rEng}It's driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.58,1:07:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定没找错人?\N{\rEng}Are you sure you have the right person?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.17,1:07:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定\N{\rEng}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.46,1:07:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧  我像未来的母亲?\N{\rEng}Come on! Do I look like the mother of the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.17,1:07:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我坚强又有组织能力吗?  我连平衡收支都不会\N{\rEng}I mean, am I tough? Organised? I can't even balance my checkbook.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.27,1:07:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有要求这个荣誉  也不想要它\N{\rEng}Look, Reese, I didn't ask for this honour and I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.31,1:08:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不要\N{\rEng}Any of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.81,1:08:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你儿子有个口信给你  他要我背熟它\N{\rEng}Your son gave me a message to give to you. Made me memorise it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.07,1:08:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"感谢你在黑暗年代的勇气"\N{\rEng}Thank you, Sarah, for your courage through the dark years.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.28,1:08:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你要面对的事我帮不到你  未来还未定案"\N{\rEng}I can't help you with what you must soon face. The future is not set.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.08,1:08:19.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你一定要比你想像中更坚强"\N{\rEng}You must be stronger than you imagine you can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.75,1:08:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你一定要活下去  否则我永不会存在"\N{\rEng}You must survive or I will never exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.21,1:08:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\rEng}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.09,1:08:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包扎得很好\N{\rEng}It's a good field dressing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.01,1:08:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗?\N{\rEng}You like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.18,1:08:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的第一次\N{\rEng}It's my first.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.97,1:08:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡一会吧  快天亮了\N{\rEng}Get some sleep. It'll be light soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.69,1:08:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.53,1:08:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跟我谈一会\N{\rEng}Talk to me some more.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.70,1:09:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈什么?\N{\rEng}About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.33,1:09:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你从哪里来\N{\rEng}Tell me about where you're from.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.00,1:09:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.42,1:09:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你白天躲起来  但晚上你可以到处活动\N{\rEng}You stay down by day, but at night you can move around.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.09,1:09:23.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你仍然要小心  因为HK会用红外线\N{\rEng}You still have to be careful because the H-Ks use infrared.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.97,1:09:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它们还不够聪明  约翰教了对付它们的方法\N{\rEng}But they're not too bright. John taught us ways to dust them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.44,1:09:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是当那些渗透者出现的时候\N{\rEng}That's when the infiltrators started to appear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.23,1:09:36.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭者是最新型的...最难对付的\N{\rEng}The Terminators were the newest. The worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.54,1:09:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它正在以搜寻模式闯进你的防区\N{\rEng}Traversing your sector in search mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.66,1:09:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你以北750米的位置\N{\rEng}750 metres north ofyour position.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.46,1:09:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\rEng}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.01,1:10:46.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-李斯  DN384...  -对  让他进来\N{\rEng}-Reese. DN384...  -Right. Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.39,1:10:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的监察者有一只爪坏了 所以要减少巡逻\N{\rEng}We're cutting short the patrol. Over
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.76,1:11:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到  扬基17  你可以安全折返\N{\rEng}Roger, Yankee-1-7.You are clear to return.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.31,1:12:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭者...\N{\rEng}Terminator!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.63,1:13:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我梦见一些狗\N{\rEng}I was dreaming about dogs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.88,1:13:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们用它们来发现毁灭者\N{\rEng}We use 'em to spot Terminators.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.72,1:13:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的世界很可怕\N{\rEng}Your world is pretty terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.88,1:14:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老友  你里面有只死猫吗?\N{\rEng}Hey, buddy, you got a dead cat in there or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.28,1:14:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能的回应: 是  不是或走开
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.35,1:14:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的  混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.19,1:14:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的  混蛋\N{\rEng}Fuck you, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.09,1:14:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈的小屋 大熊镇云杉路181号
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.21,1:15:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}God damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.92,1:15:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.57,1:15:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪基旅馆
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.93,1:15:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个够不够?\N{\rEng}Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.14,1:15:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了  我不想问你从哪得来的\N{\rEng}Yeah, it's enough. I don't wanna ask where you got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.52,1:15:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-来了  -我们要一个房间\N{\rEng}-I'm coming.  -We need a room.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.69,1:15:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好的  -要有厨房\N{\rEng}-Ok.  -With a kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.79,1:15:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有厨房的?\N{\rEng}Do you have one with a kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.04,1:15:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想洗澡\N{\rEng}I am dying for a shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.29,1:15:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要检查你的绷带\N{\rEng}We should check your bandage, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.09,1:15:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍后吧  我要出去买东西\N{\rEng}Later. I'm going out for supplies.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.55,1:15:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿着这个\N{\rEng}Keep this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.54,1:16:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈  我不能告诉你我在哪  有人叫我别说\N{\rEng}No, I can't tell you where I am, Mom. I was told not to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.21,1:16:28.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要知道在哪能找到你\N{\rEng}I need to know where to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.42,1:16:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我躲在小屋里\N{\rEng}You tell me to hide out at the cabin
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.62,1:16:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你却不告诉我怎么回事\N{\rEng}and you won't tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.76,1:16:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是担心死了\N{\rEng}I am worried sick here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.80,1:16:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  这是电话号码\N{\rEng}OK. OK, here's the number.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.80,1:16:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-准备好了吗  -嗯  说吧\N{\rEng}-You ready?  -Yes. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.22,1:16:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是4085551439...九号房\N{\rEng}It's 408 555 1439. Room nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.90,1:16:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-记下了吗?  -记下了\N{\rEng}-Got it?  -I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.90,1:16:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要挂了  抱歉我现在不能多说\N{\rEng}I gotta go. I'm sorry I can't tell you more right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.40,1:16:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈  我爱你\N{\rEng}I love you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.57,1:17:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\rEng}I love you, too, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.21,1:17:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-迪基旅馆  -把地址给我\N{\rEng}-Tiki Motel.  -Give me your address there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.43,1:17:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买了什么?\N{\rEng}What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.18,1:17:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樟脑丸...粟米糖浆...阿摩尼亚\N{\rEng}Mothballs...corn syrup...ammonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.35,1:17:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚餐吃什么?\N{\rEng}What's for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.73,1:17:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-塑料炸弹  -好极了\N{\rEng}-Plastique.  -That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.03,1:17:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.20,1:17:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硝酸甘油固定剂  这样会固定一点\N{\rEng}It's a nitroglycerin base. It's a bit more stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.91,1:17:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候学会的\N{\rEng}I learned to make it when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.80,1:18:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要沾到引线上\N{\rEng}Make sure there's none on the threads.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.01,1:18:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样\N{\rEng}Like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.51,1:18:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把盖扭上\N{\rEng}Screw the end cap on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.26,1:18:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻的\N{\rEng}Very gently.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.56,1:18:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的童年一定过得很有趣\N{\rEng}You must've had a fun childhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.61,1:18:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.57,1:18:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再多做六个  我会开始做信管\N{\rEng}All right. Six more like that and I'll get started on the fuses.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.66,1:18:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会找到我们  是不是?\N{\rEng}He'll find us, won't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.38,1:18:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\rEng}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.81,1:19:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事永远不会完结  对吗?\N{\rEng}It'll never be over, will it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.45,1:19:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我  我在颤抖\N{\rEng}Look at me. I'm shaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.74,1:19:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好一个传奇人物  你一定很失望了\N{\rEng}Some legend. You must be pretty disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.96,1:19:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  我没有失望\N{\rEng}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.63,1:19:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔  你那个时代的女人\N{\rEng}Kyle, the women in your time,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.97,1:19:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们是怎样的?\N{\rEng}what are they like?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.14,1:19:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是精锐的战士\N{\rEng}Good fighters.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.31,1:19:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思\N{\rEng}That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有意中人?\N{\rEng}Was there someone special?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.49,1:19:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意中人?\N{\rEng}Someone...?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.45,1:19:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩子\N{\rEng}A girl, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.20,1:20:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.58,1:20:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来没有\N{\rEng}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.71,1:20:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来没有?\N{\rEng}Never?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.30,1:20:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很难过  我真的很难过\N{\rEng}I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.76,1:20:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多痛苦\N{\rEng}So much pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.97,1:20:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛苦是可以抑制的  只要你不去想它\N{\rEng}Pain can be controlled. You just disconnect it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.02,1:20:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你没有感觉?\N{\rEng}So you feel nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.07,1:20:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·康纳曾经给我一张你的照片\N{\rEng}John Connor gave me a picture of you once.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.82,1:20:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我不明白原因\N{\rEng}I didn't know why at the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.03,1:20:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很旧了  有点破烂  也褪色了\N{\rEng}It was very old, torn, faded.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.71,1:21:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时很年轻  就像现在一样  看来有点悲伤\N{\rEng}You were young like you are now. You seemed just a little sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.30,1:21:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我时常猜想你当时在想什么\N{\rEng}I used to always wonder what you were thinking at that moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.60,1:21:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我谨记着每一条线\N{\rEng}I memorised every line,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.22,1:21:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一条曲线\N{\rEng}every curve.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.65,1:21:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉  我穿越了时空来找你\N{\rEng}I came across time for you, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.61,1:21:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  我一直爱着你\N{\rEng}I love you. I always have.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.71,1:21:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不该那样说的\N{\rEng}I shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.47,1:23:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想快点\N{\rEng}Think fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.68,1:24:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交换位置\N{\rEng}Trade places.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.07,1:25:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  开快点\N{\rEng}Faster. Drive faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.32,1:25:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔  我的天\N{\rEng}Kyle. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.24,1:26:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.10,1:27:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别走开\N{\rEng}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.37,1:27:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快离开\N{\rEng}Let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.21,1:27:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下车\N{\rEng}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.60,1:27:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔  站起来\N{\rEng}Kyle. Come on. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.35,1:27:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我\N{\rEng}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.32,1:28:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.78,1:28:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我  快走...\N{\rEng}Help me. Get out. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.29,1:28:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\rEng}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.14,1:28:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\rEng}Faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.81,1:28:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要停  走\N{\rEng}Don't stop. Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.52,1:30:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉?\N{\rEng}Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.90,1:30:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\rEng}Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.16,1:31:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔  我们成功了  我们成功了\N{\rEng}We did it, Kyle. We got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.85,1:31:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.78,1:32:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一会\N{\rEng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.83,1:32:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么?\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.37,1:32:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掩护  令它追踪不到我们\N{\rEng}Cover, so he can't track us.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.03,1:32:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动自动序列
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.22,1:32:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  来吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.59,1:32:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  凯尔  来吧\N{\rEng}No. Kyle. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.97,1:32:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-来吧  -别理会我\N{\rEng}-Come on.  -Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.86,1:33:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  李斯  站起来  士兵\N{\rEng}Move it, Reese. On your feet, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.61,1:33:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来  快走\N{\rEng}On your feet. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.14,1:34:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面  去后面\N{\rEng}Get back. Go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.55,1:35:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-萨拉  快逃  -不\N{\rEng}-Run, Sarah.  -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.55,1:35:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\rEng}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.56,1:35:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\rEng}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.52,1:35:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  混蛋\N{\rEng}Come on, mother fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.59,1:37:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.37,1:38:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动卸货
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.08,1:39:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋  你被毁灭了\N{\rEng}You're terminated, fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.72,1:40:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\rEng}Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.17,1:40:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第7个录音 11月10日\N{\rEng}Tape 7, November 10th.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.27,1:40:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说到哪里?\N{\rEng}Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.99,1:40:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最难决定的是该告诉你什么和不告诉你什么\N{\rEng}What's difficult is trying to decide what to tell you and what not to.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.29,1:40:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有时间考虑\N{\rEng}But I guess I have a while
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.62,1:40:40.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你长大到明白这些录音之前\N{\rEng}before you're old enough to understand these tapes
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.75,1:40:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在来说 这些录音只是给我自己的  好让我理清头绪\N{\rEng}They're more for me at this point just so that I can get it straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.66,1:41:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入满它\N{\rEng}Fill her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.13,1:41:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是否该告诉你  关于你父亲的事?\N{\rEng}Should I tell you about your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.88,1:41:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子 那是个难题\N{\rEng}Boy, that's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.63,1:41:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会影响你派他来这的决定吗\N{\rEng}Will it effect your decision to send him here
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.90,1:41:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他是你父亲\N{\rEng}knowing that he is your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.27,1:41:43.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不派凯尔来  就不会有你\N{\rEng}If you don't send Kyle, you can never be.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.27,1:41:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天  想着这件事会使人发疯的\N{\rEng}God, a person could go crazy thinking about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.07,1:41:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信我会告诉你的\N{\rEng}I suppose I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.61,1:41:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我至少该做的\N{\rEng}I owe him that.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.03,1:42:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许这有帮助的  如果...\N{\rEng}Maybe it'll help if...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.62,1:42:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这个 在我们共处的短暂的时光里\N{\rEng}you know that in the few hours that we had together,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.58,1:42:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们爱了一生一世\N{\rEng}we loved a lifetime's worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.89,1:42:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-他刚刚说什么?  -他说  "小姐  你很漂亮"\N{\rEng}-What did he just say?  -He says you're very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.77,1:42:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不敢问你拿五元的照相费\N{\rEng}He is ashamed to ask you for five dollars for this picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.98,1:42:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果他不问你要  他父亲就会打他\N{\rEng}But if he doesn't, his father will beat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.44,1:42:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  真会做生意\N{\rEng}Pretty good hustle, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.58,1:42:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚刚说什么?\N{\rEng}What did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.92,1:42:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说 有一场风暴要来了\N{\rEng}He said there's a storm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.51,1:43:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rEng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.35,1:43:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸣谢赫伦·艾里逊

